{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"不再等待无损的办法、重新行动和劲头回来都有前文依据，没有把珠子的比喻写成真实场景，也没有新增事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"保留了尽力行动但不再要求自己改变一切的心理事实，没有越界。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把珍惜的生活、必须承担的事和两者可能相互损伤的矛盾说清楚了，没有新增具体关系或场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"把珍惜生活转化为愿意承担责任的动机，没有把比喻当成实际行动场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"疲惫、不安和继续行动都是心理事实，担心也有眼前之事可能伤害珍惜生活这一明确原因。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"此前亲自行动曾给他带来力量和痛快，能够解释这次行动时劲头重新回来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"此前已经决定带着害怕去争取，直接给出了不再等待而继续行动的前因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"行动与珍惜的生活难以两全，使他不再要求自己的每一分努力都扭转全部局面。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"此前已经明确他珍惜不必防备、无需靠争抢留住东西的生活。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-3\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"此前已经说清行动和安慰难以兼得，直接解释了他为什么害怕顾住一头会伤到另一头。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S11-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"此前已经明确不争取就护不住珍惜的东西，能够解释他为什么愿意承担眼前的事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-4\",\n      \"label\": \"不成立\",\n      \"why\": \"不再证明自己坚强只是放下旧的行动动机，并没有说明他为什么会转而为了珍惜的生活承担责任。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"label\": \"勉强\",\n      \"why\": \"此前发现自己已经疲惫，能解释他为什么知道自己还会累，却不能解释为什么仍选择继续行动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S12-5\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"此前已经形成不等到完全想明白就先做能做之事的选择，能够解释这次仍带着不安继续做。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线也能看出他从不再等待、重新行动，到承认两难、明确承担责任的理由，最后带着不安继续前进，心理发展连贯。\",\n\n  \"lost\": [],\n\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e8e72e86-3beb-4419-abbb-2fa0884951b5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T003123865715Z", "elapsed_seconds": 80.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T00:32:44.765584+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "73872a65713ea1e4a54eb999e4c229cee3454eb190eba90364fa7d3734165f14", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2age